@startuml lld-us6-sequence
title LLD-US6 View Savings account details: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant AccountService
participant CbsAdapter
Browser -> AccountService : GET /accounts/{id}
AccountService -> CbsAdapter : details(id)
CbsAdapter --> AccountService : savings data
AccountService --> Browser : masked details
@enduml